        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koleweni Solomon ng’omnatet: magornatennyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kigimit Solomon weritab Daudi eng’ bounatennyi, ak kimi Jehovah Kamuktaindennyi koboto inendet, ak kiieet inendet mising’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak king’alalji Solomon Israel tugul, kiptainikab elfusiek ak che bo bogolwogik, ak kiruogik, ak bounindet age tugul eng’ Israel tugul, kandoikab gorikab kwanisiek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwa anyun Solomon koboto tuiyet tugul, komosta ne toror eng’ Gibeon; amu kimi yoto emait ne kituiyechin ne bo Kamuktaindet, ne kiga teech Musa otwogindetab Jehovah eng’ ong’atet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kiga koib Daudi moingetab Kamuktaindet kotogos eng’ Kiriat-jearim konyo ole kiga kochopchi Daudi: amu kiga koteekyi emait eng’ Jerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimi yoto kaptisisiet ne bo sugunwet ne kiyaei Besalel weritab Uri, weritab Hur, kimitei taitab gotab Jehovah: ak kiba Solomon ak tuiyet ole mi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitogosta Solomon kwo ole mitei kaptisisiet ne bo sugunwet, ne kimitei emait ne kituiyechin, eng’ taitab Jehovah, ak kogoito kagochinoik che kibeelei elfut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King’ang’jigei anyun Kamuktaindet Solomon kemounoto, ak kolenji, Som kit ne imache agonin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilenji Solomon Kamuktaindet, Kiiyachi mieindo ne o kwandanyu Daudi, ak kiyaa aek laitoriat ageer inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ara anyun, ee Jehovah Kamuktaindet, ingogimit kayomiset ne kiiyomisyi kwandanyu Daudi: amu koiyaa aek laitoriat aboi bik che te temburiek eng’ ng’ony eng’ chang’indo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kona anyun ng’omnatet ak naet, si amuch amanda ak anyo eng’ taitab bichu: amu ng’o ne imuchi koruokyi bichuguk chang’ ko u ni?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Kamuktaindet Solomon, Amu kimi ng’olyondonito muguleldang’ung’, ama isom magornatosiek, ak chang’indab tuguk, anan ko teegisto, anan kebar icheget che wechin, ama isom isob keny; ago kesomjige ng’omnatet ak naet, si kobiit iruokyi bikyuk, che kiandein iegu laitoriat ibou: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kagegonin anyun ng’omnatet ak naet; ak agonin magornatosiek, ak chang’indab tuguk, ak teegisto, che tom konyor laitorinik che kigondounenen, ama kobiitu age ne nyoru ko u noto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konyo anyun Solomon eng’ komosato toror ne kimi Gibeon, eng’ taitab emait ne kituiyechin, konyo Jerusalem; ak kilaitoran eng’ Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiiyum Solomon karisiekab luget ak bik che lanyei mbartanyisiek: ak kitinyei karisiek elfut agenge ak bogol ang’wan, ak bik elfusiek taman ak aeng’ che lanyei mbartanyisiek, che kiinde nganasokab karisiek, koboto ole mi laitoriat eng’ Jerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiyai laitoriat feda ak tahabu eng’ Jerusalem kot kotenit koik, ak kiyai taragonik kotenit mogoonik che mi emet ne soi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kigigetune Misri mbartanyisiek che kitinyei Solomon; kialei chemung’arainikab laitoriat kobee akwotisiek, akwet age tugul eng’ alyennyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiib kotogos eng’ Misri karit ne yamei sekelisiek bogol lo che bo feda, ak mbartanyit ne yamei bogol agenge ak konom: ak kiyai ko u noto laitorinik tugul che bo Hitik, ak laitorinikab Suria, kiget ichek eng’ kamugenywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
